"variable by a new one both adjusting the integrand and the limits "
"accordingly. Then evaluates the resulting integral or sum. The field "
"\"Equation\" specifies how the Old Variable and the New Variable are related "
"to each other; For sums changevar isn't intelligent enough to do more than a "
"shift of the variable.\n"
"\n"
"changevar(integrate(f(x),x,1,10),u=sqrt(x),u,x);\n"
