#: ../../src/dialogs/TipOfTheDay.cpp:209
msgid ""
"The rhs() (\"right hand side\") command allows retrieving the result of an "
"equation in exactly the format a function would have:\n"
"\n"
"    Values:[\n"
"        /* m=1.2 tons */\n"
"        m=1.2*10^3,\n"
"        /* 100 km/h*/\n"
"        v=100*10^3/(60*60)\n"
"    ];\n"
"    Energy:W=1/2*m*v^2;\n"
"    at(Energy,Values);\n"
"    W_mech:rhs(%);"
msgstr ""
"Med kommandot rhs() (”right hand side”, högerled) kan du hämta resultatet av "
"en ekvation i precis samma format som en funktion skulle ha:\n"
"\n"
"    Values:[\n"
"        /* m=1.2 tons */\n"
"        m=1.2*10^3,\n"
"        /* 100 km/h*/\n"
"        v=100*10^3/(60*60)\n"
"    ];\n"
"    Energy:W=1/2*m*v^2;\n"
"    at(Energy,Values);\n"
"    W_mech:rhs(%);"

