#: ../../src/MaximaCommandMenus.cpp:2484
msgid ""
"solve() will solve a list of equations only if for n independent equations "
"there are n variables to solve to.\n"
"If only one result variable is of interest the other result variables can be "
"used to to tell solve() which variables to eliminate from the solution\n"
"solve() searches for a global solution. If a problem has different solutions "
"depending on the range its variables are in one way to successfully use "
"solve() is to use solve() to eliminate variables one by one and to manually "
"choose which of the solutions solve() found matches the current problem."
msgstr ""
"solve() löser en lista med ekvationer endast om n oberoende ekvationer "
"motsvaras av n variabler att lösa ut.\n"
"Om bara en resultatvariabel är intressant kan de andra resultatvariablerna "
"användas för att ange vilka variabler solve() ska eliminera ur lösningen.\n"
"solve() söker efter en global lösning. Om ett problem har olika lösningar "
"beroende på variablernas intervall kan du använda solve() för att eliminera "
"variabler en i taget och själv välja vilken av lösningarna som passar det "
"aktuella problemet."

#: ../../src/wizards/WizardCatalog.cpp:543
msgid ""
"solve() will solve a list of equations only if for n independent equations "
"there are n variables to solve to.\n"
